anadian children with stroke and cerebrovascular disease</article-title><source>J Child Neurol</source><year>2003</year><volume>18</volume><fpage>714</fpage><lpage>7</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">14649555</pub-id></element-citation></ref><ref id="B9"><label>9</label><element-citation publication-type="webpage"><collab>National Center for Complementary and Alternative Medicine</collab><date-in-citation>(accessed 15 November 2006)</date-in-citation><comment>What is complementary and alternative medicine (CAM)? Accessed at: <ext-link ext-link-type="uri" xlink:href="http://nccam.nih.gov/health/whatiscam/">http://nccam.nih.gov/health/whatiscam/</ext-link></comment></element-citation></ref><ref id="B10"><label>10</label><element-citation publication-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Ernst</surname><given-names>E</given-names></name><name><surname>Barnes</surname><given-names>J</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Methodological approaches to investigating the safety of complementary medicine</article-title><source>Complement Ther Med</source><year>1998</year><volume>6</volume><fpage>115</fpage></element-citation></ref><ref id="B11"><label>11</label><element-citation publication-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Yeh</surname><given-names>GY</given-names></name><name><surname>Davis</surname><given-names>RB</given-names></name><name><surname>Phillips</surname><given-names>RS</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Use of complementary therapies in patients with cardiovascular disease</article-title><source>Am J Cardiol</source><year>2006</year><volume>98</volume><fpage>673</fpage><lpage>80</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">16923460</pub-id></element-citation></ref><ref id="B12"><label>12</label><element-citation publication-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Zick</surname><given-names>SM</given-names></name><name><surname>Blume</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name><name><surname>Aaronson</surname><given-names>KD</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>The prevalence and pattern of complementary and alternative supplement use in individuals with chronic heart failure</article-title><source>J Card Fail</source><year>2005</year><volume>11</volume><fpage>586</fpage><lpage>9</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">16230260</pub-id></element-citation></ref><ref id="B13"><label>13</label><element-citation publication-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Ryan</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><name><surname>Johnson</surname><given-names>MS</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Use of alternative medications in patients with neurologic disorders</article-title><source>Ann Pharmacother</source><year>2002</year><volume>36</volume><fpage>1540</fpage><lpage>5</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">12243602</pub-id></element-citation></ref><ref id="B14"><label>14</label><element-citation publication-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Shim</surname><given-names>BS</given-names></name><name><surname>Koh</surname><given-names>BH</given-names></name><name><surname>Ahn</surname><given-names>KS</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Education in Oriental Medicine in Kyung Hee University</article-title><source>Evid Based Complement Alternat Med</source><year>2004</year><volume>1</volume><fpage>331</fpage><lpage>34</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">15841268</pub-id></element-citation></ref><ref id="B15"><label>15</label><element-citation publication-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Kim</surname><given-names>HA</given-names></name><name><surname>Seo</surname><given-names>YI</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Use of complementary and alternative medicine by arthritis patients in a university hospital clinic serving rheumatology patients in Korea</article-title><source>Rheumatol Int</source><year>2003</year><volume>23</volume><fpage>277</fpage><lpage>81</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">14634787</pub-id></element-citation></ref></ref-list></back></article>